.TH RST 1 "October 2026" "rst 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rst \- extract and translate subtitles from video files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rst
.SH DESCRIPTION
RST is an interactive terminal application for extracting subtitles from
video files and translating them.
.PP
Run
.B rst
without arguments to open the menu. Use the arrow keys to navigate and Enter
to select an action.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Extract subtitles
Select a video, choose a subtitle track, and save it as an SRT file.
.TP
.B Extract and translate
Extract a subtitle track and create a translated SRT file.
.TP
.B Generate subtitles with Whisper
Generate an SRT file from spoken audio using the Whisper command-line tool.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/rst/
User settings are stored here by default. If XDG_CONFIG_HOME is set, the
configuration directory is
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/rst/
instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project README at
.UR https://github.com/warubert/rst
.UE
